      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been dealing with this problem for 8 months, the vrchat developers just shrug at me, they were initially hostile towards me saying the issue was on my end and not with their content server. But after some time they half realized the problem was on their end and  moved me to a 3rd party world uploaded tool \"VR build Helper\" because I was spending some days over 6 hours just trying to upload maps. The problem still happens on my main map that has over 1000 updates. The new tool takes like 1 hour uploads down to about 10 minutes so it helps a lot with my sanity. It was getting to the point where my group would watch me trying to the contact the developers on discord finding out if it was the day I lose my #)#( and get banned. Anyways hopefully this helps you on your journey into the darkness.\n\nThe developers don't seem to care as I've brought this up to them probably 5 or 6x already, so best of luck. The tool its self doesnt fix the problem, but it allows a 2nd build to be pushed through quickly if the first one fails.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
