      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64942b8d17e6c4094f3a4496|full_name}: I don't think this is the same issue. My issue is in the Vrchat client. It only started last update. I would have made a post sooner if it was happening 8 months ago. I don't have many updates on this world. I don't have issue uploading and updating the world. Its just when I'm already in the world. Do an update. Then try to just reload the instance I'm in the client wont grab the new version. Only when I go to a new instance of the world it grabs the new version. Thanks for the tool suggestion though.",
